    "UNKNOWN": "Unavailable effect summaries or undecided invariants prevent a proof; not theoretical impossibility.",
    "simplification": "Analysis-side lowering/inlining/summaries may make a proof easier. None of these registered readers requires a semantics-changing source simplification. No automatic analysis is claimed."
